cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use windkanal in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "windkanal: Stochastic Simulation Testbed for Living Clinical Data Systems"
authors:
  - family-names: "Obeser"
    given-names: "Christian"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/chrisobeser/windkanal"
url: "https://github.com/chrisobeser/windkanal"
abstract: >-
  A wind tunnel for living clinical data systems: stochastic (Monte
  Carlo) simulation of growing routine-care data streams (session-wise
  outcomes, patients nested in therapists, staggered patient entry) so
  that estimators (e.g.
  heterogeneous treatment effect methods) and analysis governance
  protocols can be stress-tested against known ground truth before
  touching real clinical data.
keywords:
  - psychotherapy-research
  - stochastic-simulation
  - monte-carlo-simulation
  - heterogeneous-treatment-effects
  - multilevel-models
  - R-package
